Post-traumatic stress disorder (PTSD),everyone has a different experience of ptsd you may have symptoms soon after the traumatic event or it may be a while before you have any some people with ptsd have symptoms all the time others will have periods where their symptoms come and go people with ptsd often relive the traumatic event through people with posttraumatic stress disorder can feel alert Oregon on edge which means you may people with ptsd often try to avoid being reminded of the traumatic event this means you may ptsd can cause difficult beliefs or feelings you may feel like you may also have overwhelming feelings of anger sadness guilt or shame,,,
Acne,acne can cause different kinds of musca volitans blackheads are small black or yellowish bumps on the skin whiteheads are similar to blackheads but may beryllium firmer papules are small red bumps that may feel tender or sore pustules are similar to papules but have a white tip in the centre this is caused by a build up of pus nodules are large hard lumps that build up beneath the surface of the skin and can be painful severe acne can cause nodules and cysts these are large pus filled lumps that can lead to scarring,,,
