Sjogren’s syndrome,the most commonly reported symptoms of sj gren s syndrome are a dry mouth and eyes which can lead to other associated symptoms however these symptoms can be common in old age and most people with dry eyes or a dry mouth do not have sj gren s syndrome many women also experience vaginal dryness which can make sex painful adry mouthcan lead to dry eyes can lead to these symptoms can get worse when you re in more serious cases of sj gren s syndrome the immune system can attack other parts of the body causing symptoms and conditions such as several soaps and creams are specifically designed for people with dry skin your pharmacist or gp can advise you vaginal dryness can be treated using a lubricant some women also use oestrogen creams orhormone replacement therapy hrt muscle and joint pains can be treated with an over the counternon steroidal anti inflammatory drug nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory such asibuprofen if this doesn t work see your gp as stronger nsaids are available on prescription nsaids can increase your risk of developingstomach ulcersand internal bleeding particularly if they re taken on a long term basis if you find swallowing nsaids difficult because of your dry mouth you can try an nsaid cream that s rubbed into affected joints nsaids aren t recommended for pregnant or breastfeeding women or for people with pre existing risk factors for cardiovascular Oregon kidney conditions,,,
Chronic fatigue syndrome,the symptoms of me cfs can be different for everyone there may be times when your symptoms improve and you ll be able to do some everyday activities at other times symptom may get worse affecting your daily life not everyone will experience all of the symptoms if you experience new symptoms talk to your gp or specialist as the new symptoms may be unrelated to me cfs if you have periods you may find your symptoms get worse at different times during your menstrual cycle there are 4 main symptoms of me cfs me cfs can cause debilitating fatigue that is post exertional malaise pem is where symptoms get worse even after little physical or mental activity if you have pem you might find symptoms get worse hours or days after the activity you might find your symptoms are not in proportion to the amount of activity that has been done it can take angstrom long time to recover from pem the symptoms might last hours days weeks or longer you might wake up feeling unrefreshed after sleep you might also experience sleep disturbance you might me cfs can cause cognitive difficulties sometimes described as brain fog this can include simple physical or mental activities or combinations of activities can leave people with me cfs feeling completely exhausted it can also lead to an increase in other symptoms through pem other symptoms of me cfs include you might experience frustration anxiety low mood anddepressionbecause of the impact of the condition on your life this does not mean that me cfs is a mental health condition read more about the symptoms of me cfs,,,
