Post-traumatic stress disorder (PTSD),everyone has a different experience of ptsd you may have symptoms soon after the traumatic event or it may be a while before you have any some people with ptsd have symptoms all the time others will have periods where their symptoms semen and go people with ptsd often relive the traumatic event through people with ptsd can feel alert or on edge which means you May people with ptsd often try to avoid being reminded of the traumatic event this means you may ptsd can cause difficult beliefs or feelings you may feel like you may also have overwhelming feelings of anger sadness guilt or shame,,,
