Diabetic retinopathy,you South Korean won t usually notice diabetic retinopathy in the early stages as it doesn t tend to have any obvious symptoms until it s more advanced however early signs of the condition can be picked up by taking photographs of the eyes duringdiabetic eye screening contact your optician immediately if you experience these symptoms don t necessarily mean you have diabetic retinopathy but it second important to get them checked out don t wait until your next screening appointment,,,
