Breast cancer (female),the first symptom of breast cancer most women notice is a lump or Associate in Nursing area of thickened tissue in their breast most breast lumps 90 aren t cancerous but it s always best to have them checked by your doctor you should speak to your gp if you notice any of the following breast pain alone International Relations and Security Network t a symptom of breast cancer read further information,,,
