Allergic rhinitis,allergic rhinitis usually causescold like symptoms such as these symptom usually start soon after coming into contact with something you rhenium allergic to some people only get allergic rhinitis seasonally because they re allergic to things like tree or grass pollen other people get allergic rhinitis all year round,,,
