Restless legs syndrome,restless legs syndrome usually causes an overwhelming urge to move your legs it also causes an uncomfortable sensation in your legs which can affect your weaponry chest and face this sensation has been described as these unpleasant sensations can range from mild to severe they re usually worse in the evening and during the night the sensation can often be relieved by moving or rubbing your legs some people experience symptoms occasionally while others have them every day you may find it difficult to sit for long periods of time like on a long train journey up to 80 of people with restless legs syndrome also have periodic limb movements in sleep plms if you have plms your leg will jerk or twitch uncontrollably usually at night while you re asleep the movements are brief and repetitive and usually happen every 10 to 60 seconds plms can be severe enough to wake up both you and your spouse the involuntary leg movements can also occur when you re awake and resting,,,
