Polio,about 95 of people with polio won t have any symptoms and will fight off the infection without even realising they were infected a small number of people will experience aflu like illness 3 to 21 days after they re infected symptoms can include these symptoms will usually pass within about a week in less than 1 of cases the polio virus attacks the nerves in the spine and base of the brain this can cause paralysis usually in the legs that develops over hours or days the paralysis isn t usually permanent and movement will often slowly tax return over the next few weeks and months but some people are left with persistent problems if the breathing muscles are affected information technology can be life threatening,,,
