Wolff-Parkinson-White syndrome,symptoms of wolff parkinson white syndrome can include how often episodes happen can vary from person to person some people might have episodes on a daily basis others may only experience them occasionally or have no symptoms at all,"When the heart beats normally, the muscular walls contract (tighten and squeeze) to force blood out and around the body. The muscles then relax, allowing the heart to fill with blood again. People with Wolff-Parkinson-White syndrome have an extra piece of heart tissue. This causes a ‘short circuit’ where the heart’s electrical signals quickly travel around in a loop. This can result in a very fast heart beat.",,"If you have symptoms of a rapid heart beat, this will sometimes settle down on its own without treatment. In some cases, medication or a treatment calledcatheter ablationis needed. In an emergency, the heart’s electrical activity sometimes needs to be reset. This is called electricalcardioversion."
