Deep vein thrombosis,swelling is one of the main symptoms of dvt it may not always be easy to notice swelling can happen in any part of your leg but normally happens in the back of the leg other symptoms of dvt include these symptoms can also happen in your arm or pot if that s where the blood clot is,,,
