Coronavirus (COVID-19),symptoms of coronavirus include less common symptoms include if you have symptoms of coronavirus you should you may still have acoughor feel tired after your other symptoms have gone this doesn t mean that you re still infectious to others mostacute respiratory infectionslike coronavirus pass within 3 weeks there are some things you can do to aid relieve your symptoms until the infection clear up antibiotics will not relieve your symptoms or speed up your recovery it s important to get help if you re at increased risk of becoming more unwell from coronavirus this includes if you re pregnant aged 60 or over or have a weakened immune system advice for people who may have coronavirus symptoms complete our self help guide to check your symptoms and find out what to do next there are things you can do to reduce the spread of coronavirus infection,,,
