Polymyalgia rheumatica,polymyalgia rheumatica often causes pain and stiffness this can affect the shoulders neck and hips these symptoms can develop quickly over a few days or weeks both sides of the body are normally affected the stiffness often feels worse first thing in the morning after you wake up it usually starts to improve after about 45 minutes as you become more active polymyalgia rheumatica may also cause if you rich person been diagnosed with polymyalgia rheumatica and you suddenly develop vision loss or changes in your vision like double vision contact an optician immediately or phone 111,,,
