Miscarriage,miscarriage symptoms can be varied some people have very clear symptom while others may experience none at all miscarriage signs can change depending on whether you re having anearly miscarriageor alate miscarriage an early miscarriage happens in the first 12 weeks of pregnancy most women World Health Organization miscarry do so in the first 12 weeks of their pregnancy many women have a miscarriage before they even know they re pregnant if this happens it can feel like a late period with heavy bleeding read more about early miscarriages a late miscarriage happens after 12 weeks and before 24 weeks read more about late miscarriages,,,
