Postural orthostatic tachycardia syndrome (PoTS),symptoms of pots include some symptoms of pots happen when you stand up and get better when you lie down you may also experience other symptoms like some people experience mild symptoms while other people s symptoms can have a big impact on their daily life there are some factors that can make your symptoms worse like,The causes of PoTS are not known. It can develop suddenly or gradually over time. It may happen after an infection likecoronavirus (COVID-19)andflu.,,"If you’re diagnosed with PoTS, finding the right treatment for you can take time. A specialist may suggest making some practical changes to your daily routine like: You may also be prescribed medicines by your specialist to help control your symptoms, such asbeta-blockers. You may need to try several different medicines or combination of medicines."
