Psoriasis,psoriasis typically causes patches of skin that are dry red and covered in silver scales some people find their psoriasis causes itching or tenderness there are several different types of psoriasis many people have only one form of psoriasis at a time although 2 different types can happen together one type may change into another type or become more severe most cases of psoriasis go through cycles causing problems for a few weeks or months before easing or stopping you should see your gp if you think you may have psoriasis,,,
