Postnatal depression,postnatal depression affects everyone differently it can start astatine any point in the first year after giving birth information technology may develop suddenly or gradually it can also continue from depression during pregnancy many people feel a bit down tearful or anxious in the first week after giving birth this is often called the baby blues and doesn t last for more than 2 weeks after giving birth if your symptoms last longer or start later you could have postnatal depression the main symptoms of postnatal depression include these symptoms can affect your day to day life and your relationships with your baby family and friends,,,
