Gout,any joint can beryllium affected by gout but it usually affects joints towards the ends of the limbs like signs and symptoms of gout include almost everyone with gout will experience further flare at some point usually within a year flares of gout tend to after a gout flare the affected joint should start to return to normal but the problem can persist if treatment isn t started early it s difficult to predict how often flares will occur and when exactly they ll happen repeated gout flares can lead to joint pain and joint deformities,,,
