Functional neurological disorder (FND),fnd can have many symptoms that can change from person to person some people may have few symptoms and some people may have many a diagnosis of fnd should be made because you have one or more clinical features that a specialist can recognise arsenic typical of fnd it shouldn t be made just because scans or tests for other neurological conditions that have similar symptoms are normal there are other symptoms or conditions that are commonly associated with fnd these include,,,
