Pancreatic cancer,in information technology early stages pancreatic cancer rarely causes symptoms the pancreas is actually 2 glands inch one and symptoms depend on which part is affected this is because most cases of pancreatic cancer are in the exocrine pancreas and the 3 most common symptoms are it s important to remember that these symptoms can be caused by many different health conditions and aren t usually the result of cancer however you should contact your gp if you re concerned or if you suddenly develop these symptoms other possible symptoms of pancreatic cancer include,,,
